@startuml course-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (course-service) - FR-03\nOwner: Ahmed Mohamed Ahmed
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface ICourse <<provided>> {
  +addCourse(studentId, data): Course
  +updateCourse(courseId, data): Course
  +removeCourse(courseId): void
  +getCourseProgress(courseId): CourseProgress
}

class CourseService <<component>> {
  -assessment: IAssessment
  -repository: ICourseRepository
  -courseCodeChecker: CourseCodeChecker
  --
  +addCourse(...) / updateCourse(...)
  +removeCourse(...) / getCourseProgress(...)
}

ICourse <|.. CourseService
class CourseCodeChecker <<component>> {
  +exists(code, semester): boolean
}
CourseService --> CourseCodeChecker

interface IAssessment <<required - Assessment service>> {
  +addAssignment(data): Assignment
  +addExam(data): Exam
  +setStatus(assignmentId, status): void
  +setExamReminder(examId, daysBefore): void
  +getDeadlines(studentId, days): List<Deadline>
}

CourseService --> IAssessment
interface ICourseRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +save(item: Course): void
  +findById(id): Course
  +findByOwner(ownerId): List<Course>
}

CourseService --> ICourseRepository
class Course {
  -courseId: String
  -studentId: String
  -name: String
  -code: String
  -instructor: String
  -semester: String
  -credits: int
  -weeklyHours: int
}
class CourseProgress {
  -completed: List<Assignment>
  -outstanding: List<Assignment>
  --
  +percentDone(): int
}
ICourseRepository --> Course
Course ..> CourseProgress
note bottom of CourseService
SOLID applied:
S - CourseService only coordinates; CourseCodeChecker each do one job.
O - new behaviour is added by new implementations, not by editing CourseService.
L - CourseService can replace any other ICourse implementation.
I - ICourse has only the operations its clients use.
D - CourseService depends on interfaces (IAssessment, ICourseRepository), not on concrete classes.
end note
@enduml
